     ],
     "props": [
      {
       "k": "clock",
       "x": 0.8,
       "s": 1.0,
       "y": 0.3
      }
     ],
     "hl": [
      "green"
     ],
     "focus": 0.4
    },
    {
     "text": "Honk. Honk. Honk. Hamza's chest was burning.",
     "cast": [
      {
       "who": "man",
       "x": 0.3,
       "pose": "slump"
      }
     ],
     "props": [
      {
       "k": "bubble",
       "x": 0.3,
       "s": 1.0,
       "y": 0.55,
       "text": "HONK!"
      }
     ],
     "hl": [
      "burning"
     ],
     "focus": 0.3
    },
    {
     "text": "Then he saw her: a mother, hands shaking, a crying child in the back.",
     "cast": [
      {
       "who": "woman",
       "x": 0.65,
       "pose": "stand",
       "role": "other"
      },
      {
       "who": "child",
       "x": 0.8,
       "pose": "sit",
       "role": "other"
      }
     ],
     "props": [
      {
       "k": "tears",
       "x": 0.8,
       "s": 1.0,
       "y": 0.62
      }
     ],
     "hl": [
      "shaking"
     ],
     "focus": 0.7
    },
    {
     "text": "He let go of the horn. And let go of something heavier, too.",
     "cast": [
      {
       "who": "man",
       "x": 0.4,
       "pose": "open"
      }
     ],
     "props": [
      {
       "k": "sparkles",
       "x": 0.4,
       "s": 1.0
      }
     ],
     "hl": [
      "let go"
     ],
     "focus": 0.4
    },
    {
     "text": "She waved a small thank-you. Seventeen seconds. That was all it cost.",
     "cast": [
      {
       "who": "woman",
       "x": 0.62,
       "pose": "stand",
       "role": "other",
       "face": -1
      },
      {
       "who": "man",
       "x": 0.3,
       "pose": "stand"
      }
     ],
     "props": [
      {
       "k": "heart",
       "x": 0.5,
       "s": 0.8,
       "y": 0.45
      }
     ],
     "hl": [
      "thank-you"
     ],
     "focus": 0.5
    }
   ],
   "ending": {
    "type": "hadith",
    "key": "bukhari-6114"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "enough",
   "theme": "plum",
   "backdrop": "city",
